  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- UNI001を追加: ノーブレークスペース（U+00A0）・ゼロ幅文字・双方向制御文字・制御文字・結合用の濁点・タグ文字など、目視で判別できないUnicode文字の混入を、文字列・識別子・空白・コメントを問わず検知（全角スペースU+3000は対象外）。正しい修正（半角スペース化・削除等）をアナライザーが判断できないため書き換えるFixは提供せず、直近の文・メンバー宣言の直前に \"// Ignore UNI001\" コメントを挿入するFixのみ提供\n      - Add UNI001: detect invisible Unicode characters such as the no-break space (U+00A0), zero-width characters, bidirectional controls, control characters, combining voiced sound marks, and tag characters anywhere in the code, including strings, identifiers, whitespace, and comments (the ideographic space U+3000 is excluded). Because the analyzer can't determine the correct correction (a normal space, removal, etc.), no Fix rewrites the character; only a Fix that inserts a \"// Ignore UNI001\" comment before the nearest statement or member declaration is provided",
